      "input_type": "VARCHAR",
      "scope": "LOCAL",
      "evidence": "DuckDB 1.5.0 also introduces a new setting to configure the `USING KEY` syntax.\n\n```sql\nSET deprecated_using_key_syntax = 'DEFAULT';\nSET deprecated_using_key_syntax = 'UNION_AS_UNION_ALL';\n```",
      "default_kind": "literal",
      "default_value": "DEFAULT",
      "default_evidence": "Currently, `DEFAULT` enables both syntax styles, i.e., allows both recursive\n`UNION`s and recursive `UNION ALL`s in `USING KEY` CTEs."
    }
  ]
}
